 SSH  infra
   ● ssh admin@infra
     from any Mac: the block in ~/.ssh/config hops through mac-mini
   ● In an editor     Remote SSH to infra
   No password: your key. Files travel through the same name; no folder of a
   Mac is shared.

 How it is reached
   ● This Mac to mac-mini  over Tailscale · as jterrazz.agent
   ● mac-mini to infra     192.168.64.7 · its Mac's private network

 Inside
   Station opens it for debugging only; your tooling owns what runs inside.
